{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of the King\u2019s Courier in a free roam, party-based RPG inspired by the classics. Serve Castle Stoneheart by carrying out dangerous orders across hostile lands. Explore towns, forests, swamps, and dungeons, fight enemies in real-time combat, solve puzzles, and uncover the kingdom\u2019s hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party-based RPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a fixed group of couriers on a dangerous path to prove your worth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-roam exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dungeons, towns, and wilderness without grid or turn restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters and enemies directly with fast-paced encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles and unlock hidden passages to continue your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Courier\u2019s duty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out perilous orders, recover the seals of fallen couriers, and uncover the dark truths behind the king\u2019s demands.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008790?t=1762359966","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008790?t=1762359966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008790/b713969a2d62a717c8c69ab9bbbdc4f82a4a2064/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762359966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008790/b713969a2d62a717c8c69ab9bbbdc4f82a4a2064/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762359966","categories":[{"descri